1 NAME Carl Jacob /Grapengiesser/
2 GIVN Carl Jacob
2 SURN Grapengiesser
2 _MARNM Grapengiesser
1 SEX M
1 BIRT
2 DATE 6 NOV 1814
2 ADDR
