1 NAME Jakob /Wattrang/
2 GIVN Jakob
2 SURN Wattrang
2 _MARNM Wattrang
1 SEX M
1 BIRT
2 DATE 23 JUL 1630
2 ADDR
3 CITY Södertälje (B)
