1 NOTE {geni:about_me} bills info feb 2010:
2 CONT
2 CONT 2.	Sofia Mathilda Wessman-2 (Fredrik Mårten-1)[2] was born on 12 Jul 1846 in Mellanbruket, Gusum, Ringarum Parish, Östergötlands län, Östergötland region, Sweden. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Notes for Sofia Mathilda Wessman: 
2 CONT
2 CONT General Notes:
2 CONT
2 CONT In 1865 Sofia married the tanner Johan Magnus Jonsson, born in 1823. The couple was divorced in 1877 “since he had not been heard from for many years”.. But in the census of 1890 Johan Magnus Jonsson was noted as a divorced man, l
2 CONC ived alone in Hässleby parish, Kalmar län, Småland region, Sweden. In 1879 Sofia was noted having moved to Grävsäter parish, Kalmar län, Småland region, Sweden as a servant woman. No sign of her in the 1890 census. She may have di
2 CONC ed or have emigrated.
2 CONT
2 CONT The couple had a daughter Sofia Catharina, born in 1865, who later on married the painter Karl Broman in Norrköping city. They had three children.
2 CONT
2 CONT Sofia Mathilda Wessman and unknown spouse married. They had the following children:
2 CONT
2 CONT i.	Ernst Emil Wessman was born in 1882 in Hannäs Parish, Kalmar län, Småland region, Sweden. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Johan Magnus Jonsson was born on 05 Jul 1823 in Vimmerby.
2 CONT
2 CONT Johan Magnus Jonsson and Sofia Mathilda Wessman were married on 08 Sep 1865. They had the following children:
2 CONT
2 CONT i.	Sofia Catharina Jonsson was born on 07 Nov 1865 in Wesstomta, Larum, Hannäs Parish, Östergötlands län, Småland region, Sweden. She married Karl Broman in Norrköping, Östergötlands län, Östergötland region,. 
