1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Williams info:
2 CONT
2 CONT 6. Claus Albert Wessman-2 (Fredrik Mårten-1) [11] föddes den 25 augusti, 1860 i Wesstomta, Larum, Hannäs socken, Östergötlands län, Småland, Sverige [12, 13]. Han dog den 20 september 1944 i Laurens, Swan Lake Twp., Pocahontas Co,
2 CONC  Iowa [12].
2 CONT
2 CONT Anteckningar efter Claus Albert Wessman: General Notes:
2 CONT
2 CONT Claes (Kallas Westman) var en sadelmakare lärling i Tryserum socken När han utvandrade 1880, 12 mars.
2 CONT
2 CONT ++++++++++++++++++++++
2 CONT
2 CONT Serafia Amalia Albertsdotter Kindvall daughter of Albert M. Kindwall and Seraphia N[14] was born on 30 Aug 1859 in Sockenstugan, Hässleby, Jönköping Län, Småland region, Sweden[13].. She died in 1918 in Laurens, Swan Lake Twp., Po
2 CONC cahontas Co., Iowa[30, 31]. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Notes for Serafia Amalia Albertsdotter Kindvall: General Notes: 
2 CONT
2 CONT Mollie's maiden name has cropped up in several records. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Mollie A. Wessman (Anna) birth record states Mollie S. Kindwelk b. Sweden is the mother. Ida S. Wessman birth record lists her as Amelia S. Kendnall. 
2 CONT
2 CONT I listed her as Kindwall because of a Kindwall family living contemporaneous to this time in Fairfield Twp, Buena Vista Co., Iowa. The similarity of the names and the proximity to each other is the only evidence I can offer. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Claus Albert Wessman and Serafia Amalia Albertsdotter Kindvall were married on 15 Aug 1884 in Cherokee, Cherokee Co., Iowa[14]. They had the following children: 
2 CONT
2 CONT +++++++++++++++++++++++++
2 CONT
2 CONT 16.	i. Theda V. Wessman[13] was born in Dec 1886 in Alta, Nokomis Twp., Buena Vista Co., Iowa[32]. She married Severt E. Swanson about 1913. She died before 1988. 
2 CONT
2 CONT ii.	Anna I. Wessman[13] was born on 02 Jan 1888 in Alta, Nokomis Twp., Buena Vista Co., Iowa[33]. She died before 1988. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Notes for Anna I. Wessman: General Notes: 
2 CONT
2 CONT The Birth record (Buena Vista Co., Book 2 pg 901 index Book 1 pg 76) lists the baby's name as Mollie A. Wessman, Claus and Mollie's 2nd child. She was married before 1910 
2 CONT
2 CONT iii.	Estella M. Wessman[34] was born on 25 Apr 1891 in Marathon, Poland Twp., Buena Vista Co., Iowa[32].. She married William Robert McAtee in 1911. She died on 28 Mar 1918 in Laurens, Swan Lake Twp., Pocahontas Co., Iowa[35]. 
2 CONT
2 CONT iv.	Ida Seraphia Wessman[13, 36] was born on 30 May 1894 in Marathon, Poland Twp., Buena Vista Co., Iowa[32].. She married Carelton Albert Caswell on 28 Aug 1917 in Cedar Rapids, Linn Co., Iowa. She died on 09 Sep 1918 in Laurens,
2 CONC  Swan Lake Twp., Pocahontas Co., Iowa[32]. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Notes for Ida Seraphia Wessman:
2 CONT
2 CONT Ida was delivered by J. Delahunt MD and was the 4th child of Claus and Mollie's.
2 CONT
2 CONT 17.	v. Conrad Albert Wessman[37] was born on 21 Jul 1901 in Laurens, Swan Lake Twp., Pocahontas Co., Iowa[12, 38]. He married Mildred Helene Alexander on 21 Nov 1923 in Swea City, Kossuth Co., Iowa[12]. He died on 07 Jun 1988 in L
2 CONC aurens, Swan Lake Twp., Pocahontas Co., Iowa[32]. Conrad was my grandmother's favorite cousin. My father, William Conrad Metz, was named for him. Coincidentally my 2nd great grandfather is Conrad Metz.
2 CONT
2 CONT ++++++++++++++++++++++++
2 CONT
2 CONT Chris Younggreen 1884/85-1907
2 CONT
2 CONT Svar: 9
2 CONT
2 CONT Re: augusti Younggren - Laurens, Pocahontas, Iowa 1895
2 CONT
2 CONT Ann Younggreen Sullivan (Visa inlägg) Inlagd: 18 januari 2005 1:19
2 CONT
2 CONT Williams info:
2 CONT
2 CONT 6. Claus Albert Wessman-2 (Fredrik Mårten-1) [11] föddes den 25 augusti, 1860 i Wesstomta, Larum, Hannäs socken, Östergötlands län, Småland, Sverige [12, 13]. Han dog den 20 september 1944 i Laurens, Swan Lake Twp., Pocahontas Co,
2 CONC  Iowa [12].
2 CONT
2 CONT Anteckningar efter Claus Albert Wessman: General Notes:
2 CONT
2 CONT Claes (Kallas Westman) var en sadelmakare lärling i Tryserum socken När han utvandrade 1880, 12 mars.
2 CONT
2 CONT +++++++++++++++++++++++
2 CONT
2 CONT Ämne: Query
2 CONT
2 CONT Efternamn:
2 CONT
2 CONT Tyvärr, vet jag inget Oss Mellan Familjen i augusti Younggreen (Younggren) och Carl A. Peterson eller Sarah Wilhelmina Wessman.
2 CONT
2 CONT Kanske de bara var grannar eller vänner.
2 CONT
2 CONT Jag kollade 1895 Iowa folkräkningen i den regionen i Iowa och hittade
2 CONT
2 CONT Felix Wessman f. ABT 1867 Sverige i den närbelägna staden Marathon, Polen Township, Buena Vista County, IA
2 CONT
2 CONT och
2 CONT
2 CONT Claus Wessman f. ABT 1861 sverige på Landsbygden Polen Township, Buena Vista County, IA.
2 CONT
2 CONT Kunde de ha Varit yngre bröder i din Sarah Wessman?
2 CONT
2 CONT Ur Laurens, Iowa historia jag har
2 CONT
2 CONT Claus Wessman gåva Mollie (Amelia?) Kimball.
2 CONT
2 CONT Claus Wessman hade en sele butik i Laurens 1905-1915.
