1 NOTE {geni:about_me} === GEDCOM Note ===
2 CONT Martha left her family home in 1854, at age 18. She moved 5 times before giving birth to  son Gustav in1860. She moved back with her mother in 1860 after having Gustav and stayed until 1863. She then moved 4 more times in the next
2 CONC  8 years before her death at age 35. Martha never marreid Gustav's father nor did she have any other children. Gustav was orphanded at age 9.
