2 CONT
2 CONT Student in Uppsala 1687-05-30 ensign at the Swedish Life Regiment to foot 1690-08-00. Lieutenant in Hastfer's Swedish regiment in Holland 1694. Captain at Wangersheim's Swedish regiment there in March 1695. Discharged in 1697. Lie
2 CONC utenant at the Swedish Life Regiment to foot 1697-01-03. Regimental Quartermaster at the Swedish Life Regiment 1701-01-29. Captain at the Life Guard 1701-10-30. Killed 1708-07-04, in the battle of Holofzin.
